{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1JN","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"约翰一书","commonName":"约翰一书","title":"约翰一书","order":62,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"5a647e478c171a404f48a7886f3eb5c96ff4e8b69bd5b85ee82458212d81ef29","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1JN/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这封信所讲述的，伊始之际便存在的生命之道，我们曾听见、曾亲眼所看见、曾仔细观察、曾亲手触摸。",{"noteId":0}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这生命已向我们显现；我们曾见过，也曾对其进行见证, 并且向你们讲述过那曾与父同在、曾向我们显现的永恒生命。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["现在，我们把所见所闻向你们讲述，让你们也可以与我们分享这友谊",{"noteId":1},"——这是与父、与父之子耶稣基督的友谊。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们之所以写这些事，是为了让我们的幸福更加完整。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["上帝是光，在他那里完全没有黑暗。这就是我们从他那里获得的、现在向你们宣讲的信息。",{"noteId":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["如果我们说自己与他享有友谊，但却生活在黑暗里",{"noteId":3},"，那就是我们在说谎，并非在实行真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但如果我们生活在光中，就像他在光中，我们就彼此分享友谊，他儿子耶稣的血就会让我们洁净，脱离所有罪。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["如果我们说自己没有罪，那是自欺，就不是行真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但如果我们承认自己的罪，上帝是值得信任的、是正直良善的，必定原谅我们的罪，让我们洁净，让我们脱离所有不义。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["如果我们声称自己没有罪，就是把上帝当作说谎者，他的道就不会在我们之中。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"已对希腊语的句子结构进行调整，确保英语的意思更清晰。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“同好关系。”","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":3}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"希腊语会用双重否定表示强调，这句话的原意为：“他身上没有黑暗，完全没有。”","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“走路。”又见1:7。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/1JN/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2PE/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}